findElement iesko vieno (pirmo) elemento
findElements iesko visu elementu

Jei randa grazina:
findElement - elementa -> Webelment
findElements - sarasa(elementu) -> List<Webelement>

Jei NEranda:
findElement - NoSuchElementException
findElements - tuscia sarasa.

Click - elementui (ne sarasui)
t.y. Elementui vieni veiksmai (click, getText etc)
Sarasui - kiti (get, size)


Elementu kurimas:
WebElement searchInput =   driver.findElement(By.name("search"));
       searchInput.clear();
       searchInput.sendKeys("kitasnaujas");


findElement (s), click, clear, sendKeys, getText
